flowchart TD
    Start([Disk Scheduling Entry]) --> InputParams[/Input Request Queue, Initial Head, Total Cylinders, Direction/]
    InputParams --> ValParams{Validate: Head & Requests in 0 to MaxCylinders-1}
    ValParams -- Error --> ErrOut[Display Cylinder Out-of-Bounds Error] --> InputParams
    ValParams -- Valid --> ChooseAlgo{Choose Disk Algorithm}

    ChooseAlgo -- FCFS --> TraceFCFS[Service requests in exact queue arrival order]
    ChooseAlgo -- SSTF --> TraceSSTF[Greedily pick unvisited request with min abs diff from current head]
    ChooseAlgo -- SCAN --> TraceSCAN[Sweep in current direction to disk boundary 199, reverse, sweep back]
    ChooseAlgo -- C-SCAN --> TraceCSCAN[Sweep to boundary 199, jump to 0, resume sweep in original direction]

    TraceFCFS --> CalcSeek[Calculate Absolute Cylinder Movements for each hop]
    TraceSSTF --> CalcSeek
    TraceSCAN --> CalcSeek
    TraceCSCAN --> CalcSeek

    CalcSeek --> SumMovement[Total Head Movement = Sum of absolute cylinder steps]
    SumMovement --> AvgMovement[Average Head Movement = Total Movement / Total Requests Serviced]
    AvgMovement --> FormatSeq[Assemble Ordered Service Sequence: 53 -> ...]
    FormatSeq --> RenderResults[/Display Sequence, Total Cylinders, and Average Seek/] --> EndNode([Return])
